1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:04,069
This is our home server. We just asked it to plan our week.

2
00:00:09,700 --> 00:00:20,409
Micelclaw is a self-hosted AI productivity OS. Notes, mail, calendar, photos, files, money — one local database, on your own hardware.

3
00:00:21,009 --> 00:00:27,580
On top, seven agents that actually know your data — on the web, on Telegram, even by voice.

4
00:00:28,509 --> 00:00:33,032
Ask for a plan. You get a real document, rendered as it's written.

5
00:00:35,509 --> 00:00:39,072
Hard question? The agents deliberate. You get to watch.

6
00:00:41,009 --> 00:00:42,908
Tell your agent to save a note.

7
00:00:45,509 --> 00:00:47,728
Open Notes. It's already there.

8
00:00:50,009 --> 00:00:53,102
Everything you keep becomes part of one graph.

9
00:00:56,509 --> 00:00:58,941
Photos you can search by what's in them.

10
00:01:01,009 --> 00:01:04,444
Files with instant previews. Share with a QR.

11
00:01:06,009 --> 00:01:08,996
Telegram, WhatsApp, Signal. One inbox.

12
00:01:10,209 --> 00:01:13,004
And real accounting. Taxes included.

13
00:01:14,409 --> 00:01:20,809
All of this runs on a mini-PC. Local models if you want. Your data never leaves home.

14
00:01:22,009 --> 00:01:26,148
Micelclaw. Your self-hosted AI productivity OS.
